This application links against or embeds the following third-party software.
Their licenses apply to those components:

1. .NET runtime libraries (Microsoft .NET)
   Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
   License: MIT - https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/main/LICENSE.TXT
