2. GirCore (GTK / WebKit / Adwaita C# bindings)
   Copyright (c) GirCore contributors
   License: MIT - https://github.com/gircore/gir.core/blob/main/LICENSE
   NuGet: GirCore.Gtk-4.0, GirCore.WebKit-6.0, GirCore.Adw-1

3. GTK 4, GLib, GObject, Gio (GNOME Project)
   License: LGPL-2.1-or-later
   https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk

4. libadwaita (GNOME Project)
   License: LGPL-2.1-or-later
   https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libadwaita

5. WebKitGTK (Apple Inc., Igalia, and contributors)
   License: LGPL-2.1-or-later and BSD-style terms
   https://webkitgtk.org/

6. GStreamer and plugins (GStreamer community)
   License: LGPL-2.1-or-later
   Used at runtime by WebKit for media capture/playback (PipeWire/Pulse).

7. libayatana-appindicator / libappindicator
   License: LGPL-2.1-or-later / LGPL-3.0-or-later
   Optional system tray indicator.


Runtime shared libraries (GTK, WebKitGTK, GStreamer, AppIndicator) are not
redistributed inside the RPM binary package; they are system dependencies.
The Flatpak bundle depends on org.gnome.Platform for those libraries.
